  "steps": [
    "Add the light coconut milk, water, and a splash of the full-fat coconut milk to a pan.",
    "Stir in the oats, chia seeds, zero-calorie sweetener, cinnamon, and sea salt.",
    "Cook over medium heat for 4-5 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the oats become creamy, and gooey. Add a little extra water if you’d like a thinner consistency.",
